{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban all use of fireworks on Remembrance Sunday",
        "additional_details": "I believe it\u2019s very unfair on them having to relive some very bad memories triggered by fireworks when they should be raising a toast to lost comrades in war.  A ban on all fireworks on Remembrance Sunday to save any veteran being triggered from past experiences that can set off the PTSD they suffer from would be a very positive step.",
        "background": "I want a ban on all fireworks on Remembrance Sunday when many veterans venture out for the day. I believe such a ban would be very welcome to veterans, many of whom can be triggered by fireworks.",
